[{"title":"广州戏题","author":"祝允明","text":"生世投閒四十年，瘴江班顶试鸣弦。\n今朝也是为官日，白日青天闭户眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10131,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙子重九戏题","author":"祝允明","text":"行年五十壮游肠，几把他乡作故乡。\n万里一身南海畔，客窗独看雨重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10132,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为口号","author":"祝允明","text":"远人羁客古今悲，昔日慵看惜别诗。\n六口一家分五处，争教不作断肠词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10133,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州别表弟赵二 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"海边三载试琴才，省问烦君两度来。\n天阔风鹏嗟转徙，秋深霜雁独飞回。\n计程驿路过江棹，属买渔蓑挂钓台。\n别酒多倾也能醉，欢情不似故园杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10134,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己卯春日偶作韩致光体","author":"祝允明","text":"亡羊何日返初岐，失马由来未用悲。\n灵药不消心底火，世情犹恶梦中棋。\n三年紫陌长虚屐，一纽铜章只碍诗。\n好景好将閒领取，淡烟明月两参差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10135,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚辰二月廿七日晓官窑舟中口号","author":"祝允明","text":"世棋年矢两相催，绝岭春深与雁回。\n无限胸中未酬事，蓬窗灯枕酒醒来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10136,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"危机","author":"祝允明","text":"世途开步即危机，鱼解深潜鸟解飞。\n欲免虞罗惟一字，灵方千首不如归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10137,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜归","author":"祝允明","text":"雨洗秋光万井明，风高云破月微生。\n还家莫道长酣寝，才听鸡声又出行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10138,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵表弟蒋煜及门生翁敏见赠喜予归田之作四首 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"中条不改旧王官，犹喜书淫共士安。\n汉女红颜非自误，阮公白眼向谁看。\n农人问稼教多秫，道士裁筠赠作冠。\n日喜车来皆长者，秪应姻旧倍添欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10139,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵表弟蒋煜及门生翁敏见赠喜予归田之作四首 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"荷锄欣种渊明田，坦腹还如懒孝先。\n登山自蜡平生屐，载酒时过远近船。\n焉知鱼鸟升沉性，齐得椿菌小大年。\n却笑人间心尚在，欲将青史订愚贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10140,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵表弟蒋煜及门生翁敏见赠喜予归田之作四首 其三","author":"祝允明","text":"忙是挥毫静弈棋，雕阑日转梦回迟。\n时从王右军临帖，戏学张京兆画眉。\n傍水近开三益径，停云徐咏四愁诗。\n新来最满平生意，楼上看山独坐时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10141,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵表弟蒋煜及门生翁敏见赠喜予归田之作四首 其四","author":"祝允明","text":"高眠不怕唤当关，一月华胥游未还。\n意在可兼无可处，身居材与不材间。\n琼敷玉藻六七子，金雀雅头十二鬟。\n愧有金陵无李白，栖霞即是虎丘山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10142,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病","author":"祝允明","text":"鞅掌思将适野情，偶缘风火便相婴。\n悬知智鄙同为虐，且喜閒忙总不行。\n服饵转令谙物性，静思因得检平生。\n医经士典都馀策，一卷《南华》万物平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10143,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"祝允明","text":"亭角楼窗取次凭，东风不送笑歌声。\n山村水郭城西路，却放朝云此处行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10144,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉室","author":"祝允明","text":"汉室咸阳建，山河百二开。\n甘泉芝草出，天马大宛来。\n宣室宵衣问，长杨献赋回。\n宁知天禄阁，不用子云才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10145,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱唐玄妙道院夜赋","author":"祝允明","text":"枕席钱唐馆，更时未北还。\n每当身作客，转觉意能閒。\n雨气横秋海，潮声入夜山。\n道人看默坐，应笑鬓轻斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10146,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山窗昼睡","author":"祝允明","text":"身在云房梦亦閒，松头鹤影枕屏间。\n一声隔谷鸣华雉，信手推窗满眼山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10147,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓黄轻车宅雨夜禁直归因戏赠","author":"祝允明","text":"黄昏冷雨湿金鞍，鞬箙提巡绕禁銮。\n星散羽林霜气肃，天临华盖夜光寒。\n鄂君去后衾犹薄，京兆归来黛已残。\n知有游人卧斋阁，一般飞梦出长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10148,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿金山寺","author":"祝允明","text":"窗中一抹海门焦，珠贝鱼龙共此宵。\n枕得善财参后石，洗来天汉转时潮。\n神游会解灵妃佩，耳静能传少女箫。\n况是梵王宫阙里，莲花叶上暂逍遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10149,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晚由震泽松陵入嘉禾道中作 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"晚发西南郭，秋深雨气偏。\n人家低似岸，湖水大于天。\n日崦长如阁，风樯不用牵。\n辞燕还入越，才费半流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10150,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晚由震泽松陵入嘉禾道中作 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"湖尾横波急，船头转港频。\n几家危傍水，一木老存身。\n黄菊看如客，青山坐送人。\n空舟随处泊，不用择行邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10151,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山行","author":"祝允明","text":"小艇出横塘，西山晓气苍。\n水车辛苦妇，山轿冶游郎。\n麦响家家碓，茶提处处筐。\n吴中好风景，最好是农桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10152,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月初峡山道中","author":"祝允明","text":"春阴春雨复春风，重叠山光湿翠濛。\n一段江南好图画，不堪人在旅途中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10153,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与吴大饮酒","author":"祝允明","text":"世事浮云几变更，邻居长听鸟嘤嘤。\n缃编俯仰閒今古，青眼摩挲老弟兄。\n树下送阄高啸饮，水边联袂细吟行。\n胸中三十年来气，终不销沉负友生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10154,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄谢雍","author":"祝允明","text":"谢家兰树有清芬，每诵澄江却忆君。\n想得山庄长夏里，石床眠看度墙云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10155,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠朱孝廉","author":"祝允明","text":"百年贞白旧高楼，傲兀风埃六十秋。\n楚聘寻常来北郭，鲁呼前后只东丘。\n书抄满箧皆亲手，诗草随身半在舟。\n前辈风流惟此老，天公多为后生留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10156,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人郊墅","author":"祝允明","text":"孤墅倚高原，扁舟晚到门。\n琴声虚草阁，月色满江村。\n霜落鱼虾出，烟收花竹繁。\n不须灯下坐，临水好开尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10157,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"足梦中句 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"远公莲作社，陶令柳为门。\n止酒用卿法，攒眉吾不言。\n白云时或出，黄菊故应存。\n二老皆寂寞，千秋谁共论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10158,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题汤三城南庄子","author":"祝允明","text":"嘉树夹茅堂，城南十亩庄。\n竹窗遥列岫，花溆密围墙。\n兔捷罝施路，鱼肥笱在梁。\n每来无世事，祗觉道心长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10159,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武帝传","author":"祝允明","text":"柞宫冯几画成王，泪落铜仙月似霜。\n王母不来方朔死，茂陵松柏自斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10160,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昆福寺","author":"祝允明","text":"坏阁尚岧峣，寒房绕寂寥。\n木撑危殿角，草出断碑腰。\n门钥凝尘灭，香炉火气销。\n竟空惟佛观，亦自有荣彫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10161,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隐者","author":"祝允明","text":"白石薜萝房，青山云水乡。\n琴传雷氏斲，书是汲丘藏。\n鹿友同无我，蜂分亦让王。\n枕中藏雅道，一卧即羲皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10162,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再挽子畏","author":"祝允明","text":"少日同怀天下奇，中来出世也曾期。\n朱弦并绝桐薪韵，黄土生埋玉树枝。\n生老病馀吾尚在，去来今际子先知。\n当时欲印枢机事，可解中宵入梦思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10163,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠承公","author":"祝允明","text":"墙外西林是宝坊，林间高卧有支郎。\n定回斜日云穿衲，吟断寒更月满床。\n妙梵远通潮隐隐，清阴分与柏苍苍。\n何时为取无生话，共了趺蒲一夜长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10164,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠邻院深上人","author":"祝允明","text":"竹院名童子，茅斋坐已公。\n亦如王舍内，却愧鲁家东。\n共味井泉接，分阴树影中。\n閒眠时倡和，律吕隔墙通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10165,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠安愚柳大中","author":"祝允明","text":"章甫玄端行秘书，穹窿山下竹林居。\n淫如玄晏道不远，愚似龙城乐有馀。\n皮几丹黄朝砚杂，烟窗铅素夜灯虚。\n人间幸有云龙遇，惭愧无因屡命车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10166,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠楞伽院老僧","author":"祝允明","text":"庭前柏树手摩挲，世寿宁如释腊多。\n何物与师相伴住，楞伽山色石湖波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10167,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠道士 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"龙子遗将海藏方，换除烟火世间肠。\n三花树顶千秋雪，七宝宫中万杵霜。\n琼管绿箫通廓落，碧文金检佩琳琅。\n松门昼掩烟萝合，独在峰头侍紫阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10168,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送苏瑾","author":"祝允明","text":"柳枝不折折梅花，带去吴中旧物华。\n白雪黄云迷雁影，片帆明日是长沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10169,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静女眠春晓","author":"祝允明","text":"陈月元非璧，荆云本是人。\n抱衾辞永夜，失枕卧娇春。\n嘶马应南陌，流莺在北邻。\n城隅如可俟，无事梦含颦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10170,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"祝允明","text":"强笑争禁别恨牵，病容憔瘦性依然。\n梨花小院留人坐，罗帐灯昏梦二年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10171,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题秉叔燕月之什 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"一饮琼浆骨不尘，五陵才子笔通神。\n帘前队队红妆坐，谁识当年姓沈人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10172,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题秉叔燕月之什 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"无限香云不断霞，凤凰台下谪仙家。\n丹山碧水桃千树，不遇刘郎未是花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10173,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜曲","author":"祝允明","text":"明月深穿辘轳井，蕉梧戍削藏石影。\n房帷萤火入还出，绡被轻围明玉冷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10174,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皓月","author":"祝允明","text":"玉田金界夜如年，大地人间事几千。\n万籁萧萧微不辨，露繁霜重月盈天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10175,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋宵苦雨","author":"祝允明","text":"井上梧桐阁上钟，林间乌鸟草间虫。\n与君尽是凄凉伴，若伴愁人最是侬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10176,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱选水仙","author":"祝允明","text":"八斗才中画洛神，翠罗轻飏袜尖尘。\n霅溪老子真能事，更比陈王写得亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10177,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边文进翎毛二首 其一 来禽画眉","author":"祝允明","text":"巫峡朝云隔翠波，仙禽无奈晚来多。\n风流只爱张京兆，日日章台走马过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10178,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徵明画草","author":"祝允明","text":"光风轻汎绿迢迢，气暖烟和未尽消。\n想得美人帘底坐，月华斜漾翠裙腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10179,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尧民小笔","author":"祝允明","text":"隐者高居不在城，閒来搦笔写平生。\n藤枝策策从何去，葑水东头吊古行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10180,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景","author":"祝允明","text":"浓云压岭雨初至，密叶障林风更多。\n只有渔翁能了事，一枚圆笠半肩蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"忽见银河水倒倾，森森毛发不胜清。\n悟来只在空山顶，卧听松风夹雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其三","author":"祝允明","text":"江曲柴门日自关，夕阳舟楫断萍间。\n寒流远近长如玉，流过渔矶便不閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十六","author":"祝允明","text":"柳风欺水细生鳞，山色浮空澹抹银。\n总道江南风景好，从前都让罱泥人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十八","author":"祝允明","text":"花满百花潭北庄，无人同出碧鸡坊。\n因风竹叶浮巾翠，落地松花上屐香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题画景三十一首 其十九","author":"祝允明","text":"寂历茅堂草树深，隐居踪迹杳难寻。\n直应独自携琴去，小答松篁太古音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10186,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彩云东飞月向西效李绅相公莺莺歌","author":"祝允明","text":"彩云东飞月向西，分光换景双凄凄。\n月华再与行云遇，人间有情谁是主。\n障红掩绿心色幽，欢情不满哀怨稠。\n伤鸾恨鹄如何许，两声嘈嘈向归路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10187,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆神妃","author":"祝允明","text":"不见瑶姬八载遥，依稀闻说返丹霄。\n灵云秀雨今何在，留与人间做寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10188,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆青娥","author":"祝允明","text":"云窗梦破十年春，浅笑深颦隔一春。\n时节风光浑似旧，灯花一颗照愁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10189,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋月","author":"祝允明","text":"铢衣犹是旧霓裳，带得清虚府里香。\n今日轻分三万斛，乞他人世绿衣郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10190,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"晃玉摇银小扇图，五云楼阁女仙居。\n行间著个秋香字，知是成都薛校书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10191,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"祝允明","text":"再降微之与牧之，依然记得转轮时。\n玭珠作性收圆业，银粉流香畅艳辞。\n紫凤占祥群玉府，金莺栖尽好花枝。\n宜公正是青春日，两鬓光华未染丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10192,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见仙","author":"祝允明","text":"宝月香云万烛红，玉容当面出帘栊。\n仙人也爱人间乐，只是人间无路通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10193,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲题","author":"祝允明","text":"锦翼文翎处处逢，彩云随月任西东。\n琼浆醉骨三千岁，玉颗联情一万重。\n狂蝶不曾离宝苑，好花都愿嫁东风。\n醉斜小杜吴王国，错认扬州十里红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10194,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杜兰香再通玉期","author":"祝允明","text":"墉城冥约久茫茫，半夜飙轮送远香。\n月堕云中千里易，玉生田下十年长。\n榆花会结填河驾，琼液寻倾止渴汤。\n何日秦楼缘事了，一声横玉两文凰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10195,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一曲","author":"祝允明","text":"一曲娇歌酒一觞，难醒难醉又难忘。\n争知一别还非易，满地月明归路长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10196,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"想得","author":"祝允明","text":"斜阳流影入房栊，复绿重红掩映中。\n想得那人新睡起，倚床闲啮绣残绒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10197,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何时","author":"祝允明","text":"曾是春楼有好期，幽欢曾遣别人知。\n一团羞颤惟愁慢，万种妖娇不定疑。\n玉穴精神迷肺腑，花房春味逗腰肢。\n何年更作朝云梦，一日悬情十二时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10198,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邀祝秀才二首 其一","author":"梦苏道人","text":"懒逐潘家榆柳尘，扶携看尽满城春。\n醉来不唱梅花曲，自度新声教玉人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10199,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邀祝秀才二首 其二","author":"梦苏道人","text":"卿月花灯彻夜明，吟肩随处倚倾城。\n明宵倘念孤寒客，共对芸窗一短檠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10200,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别后歌丽制不觉引满大醉醉中成四绝句奉纳 其一","author":"梦苏道人","text":"人言元白再来身，我道奎中降下神。\n谁遣玲珑唱新曲，江南添得十分春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10201,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别后歌丽制不觉引满大醉醉中成四绝句奉纳 其二","author":"梦苏道人","text":"红绡春堕彩云中，蜀锦吴绫一日空。\n应是天孙擎好手，特教凡世扫群工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10202,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]